  "lineage": "Devotional song of the Haratin of Mauritania, a men's practice in which a lead singer and a responding chorus sing praise of the Prophet Muhammad, giving voice to the community's spiritual life. Together with the women's bondja it forms a Haratin repertoire distinct from the music of the iggawin griots; both were recorded by a heritage-preservation project and studied by Elhadj Ould Brahim.",
